%%{init: {'sequence': {'width': 220}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client (Browser)
    participant A as Authenticator
    participant S as Server

    C->>S: 1. POST /auth/start
    S->>S: Generate & store challenge
    S-->>C: 2. Return options (challenge, rpId, allowCredentials)

    C->>A: 3. navigator.credentials.get()
    A->>A: Verify user (fingerprint/face)<br/>Sign challenge with private key
    A-->>C: 4. Return signed assertion

    C->>S: 5. POST /auth/verify (assertion)
    S->>S: Verify client & authenticator data<br/>Verify signature<br/>Create session
    S-->>C: 6. Set session cookie
